 center; width: 8.43489%; height: 25px;\" colspan=\"2\"><strong>Total Post</strong></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 31.5577%; height: 25px;\" colspan=\"2\"><strong>HCL Executive Eligibility Details</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 136px;\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 26.4017%; height: 136px;\" colspan=\"2\">Mining</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 8.43489%; height: 136px;\" colspan=\"2\">12</td>\n<td style=\"width: 31.5577%; text-align: left; height: 136px;\" colspan=\"2\">\n<ul>\n<li><strong>For Manager Post E2 :</strong> Bachelor’s Degree (B.E./B.Tech) in Mining Engineering.</li>\n<li><strong>For Senior Manager E4:&nbsp;</strong> First Class Mine Manager Certificate (Unrestricted) is also required.</li>\n<li>For More Eligibility Detail Read the Notification.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center; height: 25px; width: 26.4017%;\" colspan=\"2\">Geology</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; height: 25px; width: 8.43489%;\" colspan=\"2\">05</td>\n<td style=\"height: 25px; text-align: left; width: 31.5577%;\" colspan=\"2\">\n<ul>\n<li>Master Degree (M.Sc.) in Geology or Applied Geology.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center; height: 25px; width: 26.4017%;\" colspan=\"2\">Environment Management</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; height: 25px; width: 8.43489%;\" colspan=\"2\">03</td>\n<td style=\"height: 25px; width: 31.5577%; text-align: left;\" colspan=\"2\">\n<ul>\n<li>Bachelor Degree BE / B.Tech Degree in Environmental Engineering / Technology OR Engineering Degree with PG Degree / Diploma in Environmental Engineering, Environmental Management or Environmental Science.</li>\n<li>For More Eligibility Detail Read the Notification.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 26.4017%; height: 25px;\" colspan=\"2\">Safety &amp; Fire Services</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 8.43489%; height: 25px;\" colspan=\"2\">04</td>\n<td style=\"width: 31.5577%; height: 25px; text-align: left;\" colspan=\"2\">\n<ul>\n<li>BE / B.Tech Engineering Degree with PG Degree / Diploma in Safety Engineering Management OR B.Tech in Safety Engineering / Fire Engineering.</li>\n<li>For More Eligibility Detail Read the Notification.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 26.4017%; height: 25px;\" colspan=\"2\">Concentrator (Mineral Processing)</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 8.43489%; height: 25px;\" colspan=\"2\">03</td>\n<td style=\"width: 31.5577%; height: 25px; text-align: left;\" colspan=\"2\">\n<ul>\n<li>B.E./B.Tech in Mineral Engineering or Mineral &amp; Metallurgical Engineering.</li>\n<li>For More Eligibility Detail Read the Notification.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 26.4017%; height: 25px;\" colspan=\"2\">Electrical</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 8.43489%; height: 25px;\" colspan=\"2\">09</td>\n<td style=\"width: 31.5577%; height: 25px; text-align: left;\" colspan=\"2\">\n<ul>\n<li>Bachelor’s Degree (B.E./B.Tech) in Electrical Engineering.</li>\n<li>For More Eligibility Detail Read the Notification.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 26.4017%; height: 25px;\" colspan=\"2\">Instrumentation</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 8.43489%; height: 25px;\" colspan=\"2\">03</td>\n<td style=\"width: 31.5577%; height: 25px; text-align: left;\" colspan=\"2\">\n<ul>\n<li>Bachelor’s Degree in Instrumentation Engineering, Electronics &amp; Communication Engineering, or Electronics &amp; Telecommunication Engineering.</li>\n<li>For More Eligibility Detail Read the Notification.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 26.4017%; height: 25px;\" colspan=\"2\">Mechanical</td>\n<td styl